Package: claude-agent-trentina
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: crunchtools <scott.mccarty@crunchtools.com>
Depends: claude-agent (= @VERSION@-1)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/crunchtools/claude-agent
Description: crunchtools agent policy for claude-agent
 The Trentina gateway is the only MCP server, claude.ai connectors and web
 tools are off, only managed hooks run, and Claude Code's local file memory
 stays empty. It applies to every Claude Code session on the machine.
